  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "C\u2019est aussi ce que Herlock pense, il m\u2019a dit que j\u2019avais l\u2019air
      ridicule."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Si m\xEAme le Capitaine pense \xE7a, c\u2019est que \xE7a doit vraiment \xEAtre
      affreux."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Si je veux \xEAtre un vrai pirate, je dois d\xE9j\xE0 me trouver une tenue
      digne de ce nom.\r\n"
